# Savestate round-trip corpus for Spyro 1, read by
# tests/harness/check_state_roundtrip.sh.
# Fields: source | card | boot flags | save key | deferral | load key
#   source     a bk2 under games/spyro-1/bk2/, or `-` for a boot with no movie
#   card       `-` the game's own boot flags (oracle.conf RUN_ARGS); `none`
#              no card (--no-card); `unformatted` a scratch card of 131072
#              zero bytes in port A with port B empty; a fixture file under
#              tests/golden/<game>/ copied to a scratch card in port A with
#              port B empty
#   boot flags `-` or arguments added to every leg of the row
#   save key   `-` or the feed key at which the same-key leg arms
#              --state-save-on-frame and --state-load-on-frame
#   deferral   optional; `>0` asserts the same-key leg deferred its requests
#              to a later final yield; `loop` asserts that and a request
#              deferred at a yield an emitted polling-loop delivery took
#   load key   optional; a feed key L above the save key K: the state saved
#              at K is loaded at L by the run that saved it and by a fresh
#              process, and every row of both must match clean
artisans-lp-waterfall.bk2      | - | - | - |
town-square-portal-entry.bk2   | - | - | - |
exit-level.bk2                 | - | - | - |
beast_makers_wall.bk2          | - | - | - |
